  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Domus Academy in Milan is one of Italy’s top institutions for design, fashion, and business innovation. The academy offers you a range of programs, including Bachelor's and Master's degrees, as well as advanced and short courses.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>As a student at Domus Academy, you’ll be part of a vibrant international community of over 4000 students. You’ll find many state-of-the-art facilities, including specialised labs for design and fashion.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>Domus Academy doesn’t have on-campus dormitories, but it offers plenty of support to help you find your ideal place to live in Milan. Through partnerships with trusted housing providers, you can choose from shared apartments, studios, or co-living spaces located near campus.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>At Domus Academy, you’ll find a library with an extensive collection of books and magazines. In addition to this, you’ll also have access to online databases.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>At Domus Academy, you’ll find state-of-the-art facilities for Design and Fashion. Their Design Lab is a versatile space equipped with advanced tools and machinery, including precision cutting machines and 3D printers. If you’re enrolled in the Fashion Design programs, you can use the Fashion Lab with high-quality sewing machines, mannequins, irons, and more.</p><p><strong>Cafeteria</strong><br>At Domus Academy, you can enjoy a vibrant dining experience at The Corner, the on-campus cafe and self-service restaurant. You can unwind on the rooftop terrace of the cafe for a pleasant environment.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
